  "releaseNotes": "### Fixed\n\n- Fantomas.Client: LSPFantomasService.Dispose leaves its mailbox loop running, keeping the log delegate alive. `Dispose` now tells the loop to stop rather than relying on cancelling the wait it is parked in, and disposes the mailbox. A request made once `Dispose` has started is answered as cancelled straight away, and `ClearCache` on a disposed service returns rather than waiting forever. [#3529](https://github.com/fsprojects/fantomas/issues/3529)",
